On Jul 30, 4:25 am, seryb...@gmail.com wrote:
> I'm playing a promising neutral healer, and i never changed my god
> before.
> The question is: if you change god is there the change to get the new
> alignement's artifacts? and what if you get crowned before the change?
>

Assuming you want a better weapon (Grayswandir) than the neutrals get,
you don't need to permanently convert your alignment to use a
different altar.  Just slip on a helmet of opposite alignment, have
fun camping, and then remove the helmet.  You might need a few tries
putting the helmet on and off since the RNG will randomly assign you
to Lawful or Chaotic.  As for crowning, the only alignment specific
effect of crowning is the chosen gift and the different prayer
timeouts (except of course for wizards and monks who get "special"
gifts).

